1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:06,320
Dad, school is so far. It's a ten-minute
walk!

2
00:00:06,670 --> 00:00:11,740
Ten minutes? When I was your age...

3
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:18,266
Every morning, I would wake up before the
rooster, tie my books with string, and

4
00:00:18,266 --> 00:00:19,250
start walking.

5
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:27,070
Not ten minutes. Hours. Hill after hill,
with no shoes.

6
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:36,296
Then came the Blue Nile. I would hold my
books over my head. There was always a

7
00:00:36,296 --> 00:00:39,880
hungry crocodile. I never stopped.

8
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:47,389
Next, the Chebera Churchura jungle.
Elephants used to block the path, so I

9
00:00:47,389 --> 00:00:49,890
would walk right under them.

10
00:00:50,790 --> 00:00:58,634
Then I would climb the Simien mountains.
The geladas just used to watch me, without

11
00:00:58,634 --> 00:00:59,390
helping.

12
00:01:00,290 --> 00:01:09,169
And then, the volcano. Erta Ale. I would
jump from rock to rock over the lava. My

13
00:01:09,169 --> 00:01:11,910
feet were always on fire.

14
00:01:12,810 --> 00:01:21,379
Finally, wet and smoking, I would reach
school. And every day, my teacher would

15
00:01:21,379 --> 00:01:22,030
say...

16
00:01:22,380 --> 00:01:24,440
You're late again!
